# Ars Magica Fifth Edition, Against the Dark — Front Matter (Lore)

**Version:** 0.5.1
**Source:** Against the Dark (Atlas Games) — Ars Magica Fifth Edition, credits and Author Biographies (p. 2)
**Publisher:** Atlas Games

> The credits and Author Biographies, verbatim. The printed Contents and List of Inserts (pp. 3–5) are a finding
> aid for the book’s own pages and are not converted — every unit they list is converted in its chapter. Page 1 is
> the cover, with no text; the book has no back cover.

